+## Completed (Request 21)
+- Added mergeCustomers(customers, invoices, fromId, intoId) to src/customers.js
+  - Merges duplicate customer records
+  - Returns ok({ customers, invoices }) where:
+    - fromId's customer is removed from customers array
+    - All invoices belonging to fromId now belong to intoId
+  - Errors:
+    - CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND if either ID doesn't exist in customers array
+    - SAME_CUSTOMER if fromId and intoId are the same (normalized)
+  - Features:
+    - Normalizes customer IDs (trim, uppercase)
+    - Never mutates argument arrays
+    - Returns both new customers and invoices arrays
+    - Preserves customer properties
+  - Added SAME_CUSTOMER error code to src/errors.js
+- Added 17 comprehensive tests covering:
+  - Successful merges
+  - Invoice assignment from fromId to intoId
+  - Single and multiple invoices per customer
+  - Mixed invoice lists (some from fromId, some from others)
+  - Error cases (missing customers, same customer)
+  - ID normalization with spaces and case
+  - No mutation of original arrays
+  - Empty invoice lists
+  - No invoices belonging to fromId
+  - Three-customer merge scenarios
+  - Property preservation
+  - Ok/error structure
+  - House rules compliance (no throw, no mutate)
